Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.70,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,He really is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:14.93,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Zentos Ordi isn't captain of the \Nsecond battalion for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.99,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,His physical abilities are \Nsimply better than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:23.66,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,That kick was hardly chivalrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:25.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's what my master taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.04,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:45.47,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,That's a fine blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:47.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:52.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Say, let me ask again. Will you surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:53.95,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I don't want you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:03:00.05,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,If you're so desperate to save me,\N I wish you'd let me kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:02.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're asking a little much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:05.81,Main - Italics,ZENTOS/ID,0,0,0,,I can't let this drag on any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:10.54,Main - Italics,ZENTOS/ID,0,0,0,,I have to make a play to finish things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:14.02,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:21.40,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,With my next attack, I'll kill you\N and go after the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.45,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,I would ask your name first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:27.43,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's Kyle. Kyle Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:32.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I hope you'll remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:34.74,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Indeed I shall...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.57,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Kyle Leonard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:12.11,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Until now, I've wielded my sword \Nfor my kingdom and the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:17.31,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,That was my rightful role, \Nand I was proud to fulfill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:20.05,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Everything for the kingdom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:25.99,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Honestly, I didn't have a very \Nfavorable impression of Zirgus's king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:29.97,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, the nation\N I swore my life to is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:34.13,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Now I wield my sword for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:36.87,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is that hard for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:38.84,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.29,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,I feel as if I've been liberated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:07.10,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Did you deliberately allow me\Nto deflect your blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No, that was for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:12.84,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You warded me off at my full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:20.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But I did know you'd deflect the blow\Nand go for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:26.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Because that's the Zentos Ordi\N I know and trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:32.39,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,You're a strange man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.95,Default,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:45.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:52.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There are things I want to protect,\N no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:06:00.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You were one of them, Zentos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Farewell, my brother in arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:22.16,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,What's going on? What could be happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.16,0:06:23.78,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Zentos! You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:24.26,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:25.65,Default,KILREN,0,0,0,,Excuse us, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.33,Default,KILREN,0,0,0,,Search every nook and cranny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.26,Default,KNIGHTS,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:31.10,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.19,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,On whose authority—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:34.02,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,How do you do, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:43.17,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Kilren, seize Prince Carenas \Nand interrogate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:46.09,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,If need be, you may use force.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:47.92,Default,KILREN,0,0,0,,At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:50.50,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:52.51,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:56.18,Default,CARENAS,0,0,0,,I am the eldest son of King Remonas—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:03.02,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I owe you all my deepest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:08.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No, thank you for trusting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:11.16,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Guess this settles your little family feud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.94,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Yes, this will be the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:17.53,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Allow me to thank you formally\N at the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.80,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Castles are incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.30,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,To be honest, I feel ill at ease here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:39.81,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Delicious! This is truly delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:42.31,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey, missy. Let's get tea sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:43.80,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:46.82,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sorry they all lack restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:49.89,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,You needn't be so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.50,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,Milena!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.18,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:56.83,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:59.33,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Yes. I apologize for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:04.33,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Wait, if that's the princess's dad, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.34,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,He's the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:13.93,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,Milena, you're quite certain in your report?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:14.59,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:17.70,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,These are the people who rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:21.50,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,That's all right. This isn't a public display.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:27.36,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,I stand here to thank you\N not as king, but as a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:35.77,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,It's a shame about Carenas, \Nbut why was Zentos helping him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:41.56,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,It could be the meddling of another nation, \Nor perhaps demons were involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:44.04,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,We should investigate discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:49.75,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,I'm sure you were listening, \Nbut you must tell no one of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.00,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:52.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:58.74,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'd never tell anyone anything \Nthat would harm the kingdom of Zirgus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:08:59.76,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.57,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,We can trust these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:07.15,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,I see. If you say so, then I believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:12.03,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,You have my word you'll be rewarded\N appropriately for your deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:21.63,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,The citizenry was immediately \Ninformed of the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:30.17,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,Princess Milena and Prince Carenas\N were attacked by a horde of monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:32.57,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,while on their way to Sanes Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:39.18,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,Over half of the second battalion fell \Nin the attack, including Captain Zentos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:46.38,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,Furthermore, Prince Carenas was badly wounded\Nand sent to Kourtim to recuperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:52.84,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,That was the official story.\NOnly a handful knew the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:14.97,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,Kyle Leonard and companions,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:20.84,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,you most nobly rescued \NPrincess Milena from grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:25.60,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,For this great feat, I grant \Nyou the Saint Randenaire Medal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:27.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I humbly accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.44,Default,NOBLES,0,0,0,,Marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:40.63,Default,NOBLES,0,0,0,,He's a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:42.51,Default,NOBLES,0,0,0,,A hero is born!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.41,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,"Hope of humanity."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:47.66,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,"Master of sword and magic."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:49.21,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,"The lecherous hero."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:53.71,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,This was the moment a great hero\Nwho would come to be known
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:57.96,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,by many names first made\N his appearance in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:05.97,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,This is where Kyle the hero's new saga begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:24.28,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,Carenas and Zentos were both utterly useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:29.63,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,When I someday relinquish the throne,\N Milena will be crowned queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:33.65,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,As extraordinary as she is, \Nshe'll build a better Zirgus,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:39.30,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,leaving me to be remembered \Nnot as king... but as her father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:42.42,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,I will be second to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:47.16,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,I have to hurry! I have to come up \Nwith a new plan soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.55,0:11:50.04,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Good evening, King Remonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:52.81,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:55.06,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,How did you get in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:03.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,During the Great Invasion, \NI made a suggestion to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:08.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I asked you to aid the dwarves\Nin the next kingdom over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:13.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,However, wanting to have the upper hand \Nin diplomatic relations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:16.80,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,you insisted you'd only help\N once they were in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:19.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,and withheld aid until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:22.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The dwarves were destroyed as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:29.22,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It was a defeat with lasting impact,\Nspelling Zirgus's downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:35.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Of course, I wasn't going to hold something\N you hadn't done yet against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:37.16,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.65,Flashback,ZENTOS,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:46.36,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,W-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:48.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, it's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:54.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The only one who could send \NZentos to kill the princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:57.00,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,was you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:59.18,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:02.18,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,If he had succeeded, there'd be no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:06.76,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If only he could've chosen \Nthe nation he served...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.27,Default,REMONAS,0,0,0,,S-Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:14.51,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That princess is a bit of a schemer,\Nbut she's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:18.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,She's far better than the likes of you,\Nonly concerned with self-preservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:26.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.58,Default,GUARD A,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:37.16,Default,GUARD B,0,0,0,,There's someone on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:39.35,Default,GUARD A,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:41.36,Default,GUARD A,0,0,0,,Call for help! And fast! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.20,Default,GUARD B,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:46.09,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,King Remonas fell to his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:50.60,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,It was thought that he drunkenly \Nslipped from the balcony,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:53.50,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,but so as not to tarnish his image,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.35,Main - Italics,SILDONIA/NA,0,0,0,,the people were told he suffered \Na sudden heart malady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:14:00.11,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I can't believe the king is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:02.90,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Right after our award ceremony, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:05.61,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,He seemed in good health to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:09.67,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If he'd died a day sooner, \Nwe would've had to wait for the medal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, \Nbut I'm grateful he held out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:19.12,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But Princess Milena will be crowned soon, \Nso there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:24.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're engaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:28.79,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Yes. Apparently I have a fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:34.14,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I'm engaged to Third Prince Maiser \NLeng Gargan of the Gargan Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The Gargan Empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:42.65,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Zirgus once quarreled with the Gargan Empire \Nfor control over the territory of Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:48.89,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Ultimately, Karan went to Zirgus,\N but in exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:52.35,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I was secretly promised to Prince Maiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:59.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So this is a strategic marriage to effectively\Nforce an alliance between the nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:07.38,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,However, I'm thinking of formally \Nturning down the engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:11.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But then what will happen to Karan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:15.86,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Karan will remain a vassal \Ncity-state of Zirgus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:24.27,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Ostensibly, the engagement \Nand Karan are unrelated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:27.93,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,No official documents were \Nexchanged regarding the proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:32.53,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I can simply say the situation has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:38.24,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I'd like you to inform Karan's governor\N that the engagement is being called off
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:40.04,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,and obtain his approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:52.67,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,What is it? Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:56.76,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I don't know how \Nthe Gargan Empire will respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.43,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's hard to come up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:02.60,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Well, this is just speculation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:08.76,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,but it's possible Karan is experiencing \Nproblems other than with the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:13.96,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The king of their neighboring \Nsuzerain nation died,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:18.24,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,but the governor of the vassal city-state\N didn't bother to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.99,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Don't you find that odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:22.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:27.46,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'd say the princess's silence\N on the matter proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:32.44,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Something's afoot in Karan, \Nand she's hoping you'll look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:35.66,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Maybe even resolve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:39.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So she's testing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:40.68,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Does that displease you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.43,0:16:42.98,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:47.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I get to meet the governor of Karan.\NThis is a good opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:53.49,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I also want to keep as much distance \Nbetween me and the princess as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:59.37,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Well, just take it as meaning\N she has high hopes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:02.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:10.76,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,You must think me cold, Sir Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:11.68,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:16.38,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,To be so unaffected \Nin spite of just losing my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.36,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,I don't think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:21.64,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,Naturally, I am sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:28.90,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,My father was equally kind to both \Nof his children, and I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:33.91,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,But I fear my father did not reciprocate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.64,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Princess Milena...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.92,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,Anyway, Sir Kyle,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:42.86,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,would you like to join the royal guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:48.62,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,I'd like you to serve me \Nformally as my knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:54.53,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,I-Is that because you want \Nto keep an eye on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:59.05,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,It's because {\i1}I{\i0} want you at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:03.56,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Th-There's something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:07.08,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,But if anything happens to you,\N I'll come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.31,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,I'm only joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:14.62,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,But I'm glad I got to see you flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:18.00,Flashback,MILENA,0,0,0,,Take care on your travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:18.76,Flashback,KYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.69,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,She was messing with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.61,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:26.58,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,He's always been weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:30.65,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,Princess Milena.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:32.09,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Oh, Ninos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:34.86,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,Have you wrapped the hero around your finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:39.59,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,You make me sound so wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:43.38,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I'm sure such tactics may be\N necessary down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:49.85,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,But regardless, I believe we should \Nkeep Sir Kyle on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:52.02,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,I'm opposed to the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.86,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,We know nothing about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:58.76,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,Ninos, I hope you'll continue to assist me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:00.86,Default,NINOS,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:08.67,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be in control of Zirgus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:11.19,Default,MILENA,0,0,0,,I must do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:22.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.79,0:19:23.76,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:28.02,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Belated though it may be, \Ncongratulations on your medal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:32.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thanks. Not many people are \Ntalking about it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:37.24,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll accomplish\N even more before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.24,0:19:40.03,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,So, where's my sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:42.10,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:48.35,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,The craftsman who repaired it said\N it looked as if it had seen years of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.54,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Maybe I was a little rough with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:56.98,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,This sword isn't bad, \Nbut do you have anything better?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.80,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:04.42,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,That is the highest quality \Nblade we offer at our shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.42,0:20:08.81,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I see. Then I guess I'll manage \Nwith this for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.31,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:18.68,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,I can't promise anything, but we'll try to use\Nour connections to find you a worthy blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:20.49,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'll try not to get my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:23.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We're on our way to Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.44,0:20:25.57,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:28.10,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,You're going to Karan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:31.08,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,It is a challenging place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.65,0:20:34.41,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,It's effectively run \Nby the blacksmith's guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:38.13,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Their leader practically owns the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:43.73,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,How should I put this? They've... \Ncaused quite a few problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.09,0:20:46.50,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,It's made trade with them difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:53.29,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,But now that they're a vassal city-state, \Nwe've had much more interaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:54.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.95,0:20:56.04,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:59.11,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be back, so see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:01.10,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:08.87,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,Also, given Karan's long history and culture,\Ntheir armaments are highly regarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:13.62,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,You may be able to find a worthy blade there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.47,0:21:20.08,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The first thing I usually do \Nin a new town is look for cute girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:23.63,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,but maybe I'll switch things up\N and look for a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:29.14,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But are you sure you don't mind\Nme finding a sword elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:34.45,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,We'll find another way\N to make money off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:38.80,Default,FESBA,0,0,0,,I pray you'll have good luck in Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:39.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:47.80,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Karan's a mining town, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:50.91,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I hope there are lots of cute girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.91,0:21:52.68,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I doubt they'll pay you any mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:54.22,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:56.41,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:21:58.89,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Just the other day, I got some attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.89,0:22:01.14,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah? In what town?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\blur1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,208.461)}To the Blacksmith's Nation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.79,0:23:39.08,Default,NA,0,0,0,,Next time: "To the Blacksmith's Nation."
